00:30:09.400 --> 00:30:14.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pangalagaan ang ating teritoryo at itaguyod ang ating dignidad bilang isang malayang bansa.

asr-000207
00:30:16.360 --> 00:30:23.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Noong nakaraang taon, katuwang natin ang mga kasamahan sa Senado at sa pangunguna ni then Finance Chair

asr-000208
00:30:23.380 --> 00:30:25.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at ngayon ay Senate President Sherwin Gatchalian.

asr-000209
00:30:25.580 --> 00:30:31.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sinuporta natin ang paglalaan ng karagdagang pondo para sa AFP Modernization.

asr-000210
00:30:31.760 --> 00:30:38.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa ilalim ng inyong kasalukoy budget para sa 2026, umabot sa 90 billion ang pinagsamang alokasyon

asr-000211
00:30:38.140 --> 00:30:43.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa revised AFP Modernization Program, 40 billion sa program appropriations

asr-000212
00:30:43.040 --> 00:30:45.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at 50 billion sa unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-000213
00:30:46.500 --> 00:30:53.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nais po natin malaman kung gaano nakalaki sa pondong ito ang aktual na nailabas, na obliga at nagastos

asr-000214
00:30:53.680 --> 00:30:55.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at kung ano ang katumbas.

asr-000215
00:30:55.580 --> 00:30:59.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At itong progreso sa ating mga proyekto na pangmodernisasyon.

asr-000216
00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:05.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alin sa mga inaasahang kagamitan at sistema ang nahihatid na at nagagamit ng ating masundalo?

asr-000217
00:31:06.640 --> 00:31:08.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anong mga hadlang sa pagpapatupad?

asr-000218
00:31:09.020 --> 00:31:16.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At alin ang mga pangangailangan ang dapat nating unahin sa pagbabalangkas ng budget para sa fiscal year 2027?

asr-000219
00:31:17.460 --> 00:31:21.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As Chair of the Senate Committee on Finance, and as I have done so for many years,

asr-000220
00:31:21.220 --> 00:31:23.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I reaffirm our commitment to sustaining the AFP's modernization

asr-000221
00:31:23.760 --> 00:31:26.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with our fiscal constraints.

asr-000222
00:31:27.420 --> 00:31:35.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kapag hinahamak ang ating bandila at kinigipit ang ating mga kababayan sa sarili nating mga karagatan,

asr-000223
00:31:35.800 --> 00:31:39.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dapat malinaw ang ating prinsipyo at matatag ang ating tugon.

asr-000224
00:31:40.300 --> 00:31:43.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa gitna ng maraming mga hamon at kinakaharap ng ating bansa,

asr-000225
00:31:43.620 --> 00:31:51.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kailangan buo ang ating loob at nagkakaisang ating pagtindig na mapagtatanggol ng pambansang interes.

asr-000226
00:31:52.580 --> 00:31:53.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito ang diwa ng pambansang interes.

asr-000228
00:31:53.740 --> 00:31:57.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito ang pangakong ating binibigas sa tuwing inaawit ang lupang hinirang,

asr-000229
00:31:58.340 --> 00:32:02.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na sa harap ng sino mang manlulupig kailanman ay hindi tayo pasisiil.

asr-000230
00:32:02.900 --> 00:32:07.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I remain steadfast in my belief that defending our nation's honor and sovereignty

asr-000231
00:32:07.380 --> 00:32:13.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: through the attainment of a credible defense posture must transcend partisan loyalties,

asr-000232
00:32:13.640 --> 00:32:16.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: political considerations, and personal interests.

asr-000233
00:32:16.820 --> 00:32:20.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The defense of our nation must always rise above politics

asr-000234
00:32:20.420 --> 00:32:23.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and remain firmly anchored in our shared commitment

asr-000235
00:32:23.580 --> 00:32:27.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to national security, sovereignty, and the Filipino people.

asr-000236
00:32:27.440 --> 00:32:28.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000237
