DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Mindoro.

asr-000567
01:02:03.260 --> 01:02:08.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Our presence, too, in Mindoro is only one brigade.

asr-000568
01:02:09.420 --> 01:02:16.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And with the size of Mindoro, Your Honor, that is not sufficient.

asr-000569
01:02:16.820 --> 01:02:21.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In northern Luzon, we have only one division for how many provinces?

asr-000570
01:02:21.940 --> 01:02:25.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we only have one naval force.

asr-000571
01:02:26.680 --> 01:02:27.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In that...

asr-000572
01:02:27.500 --> 01:02:31.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In that area, which spans the South China Sea to the Pacific Ocean.

asr-000573
01:02:32.880 --> 01:02:41.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we really need to refocus our strategic positioning in these areas, Your Honor.

asr-000574
01:02:41.560 --> 01:02:43.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we cannot do that until...

asr-000575
01:02:44.360 --> 01:02:50.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sustainably, until the army solidifies its footprint in the Philippines.

asr-000576
01:02:50.760 --> 01:02:56.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, capital outlay, Your Honor, is extremely important.

asr-000577
01:02:57.500 --> 01:03:07.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Also, for building critical infrastructure facilities for security of our platforms and security of our operations.

asr-000578
01:03:07.360 --> 01:03:22.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I believe the capital outlay gap has been one of the major gaps that we have found out right now we have to catch up badly with.

asr-000579
01:03:23.020 --> 01:03:27.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it includes also access to our bases.

asr-000580
01:03:27.500 --> 01:03:33.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In terms of the durability of the infrastructure.

asr-000581
01:03:33.720 --> 01:03:37.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For example, the roads and bridges that will link our bases.

asr-000582
01:03:37.860 --> 01:03:46.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We have found that normal roads and bridges will not be able to support some of the platforms that we have currently because of the weight.

asr-000583
01:03:48.340 --> 01:03:51.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, our mobility is a sacrifice.

asr-000584
01:03:53.040 --> 01:03:56.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We cannot really bridge the whole of the Philippines.

asr-000585
01:03:56.500 --> 01:03:56.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes.

asr-000586
01:03:57.500 --> 01:04:10.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, the best that we can do is to provide hubs, as many hubs as possible, which will support sustained operations.

asr-000587
01:04:11.120 --> 01:04:20.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Secondly, Your Honor, just like any other entity in the world right now, it's not a matter of just in time, but a matter of reserves and stores.

asr-000588
01:04:21.160 --> 01:04:26.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And that we are busy building up our reserve and stores.

asr-000589
01:04:26.480 --> 01:04:26.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Not only in...

asr-000590
01:04:27.500 --> 01:04:35.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In terms of munitions, but we need it also in terms of petroleum, oil, and lubricants.

asr-000591
01:04:35.040 --> 01:04:57.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We have big notional amounts of petroleum ready, but if we do not have physical custody of this, we will be relying on private gas stations to serve our needs, which is a vulnerability of our operating troops.

asr-000593
01:04:57.580 --> 01:05:11.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it poses difficulties for the troops rather than have them serviced in a durable basis, perhaps up to the battalion level.

asr-000594
01:05:15.120 --> 01:05:16.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000596
01:05:21.580 --> 01:05:26.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The breakdown of regular fund versus...

asr-000597
01:05:27.500 --> 01:05:33.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The 2026 and 2027 comparatives, Your Honor.

asr-000598
01:05:36.920 --> 01:05:47.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we have a slight increase of 6.13% versus last year of 18 billion.

asr-000599
01:05:49.540 --> 01:05:56.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But I believe the increase is reflected more in MOOE.

asr-000600
01:05:57.500 --> 01:06:01.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Than any other item.

asr-000601
01:06:01.760 --> 01:06:02.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000602
01:06:10.380 --> 01:06:12.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Modernization, Your Honor.

asr-000603
01:06:12.960 --> 01:06:20.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 2026 was 90 with the programmed of 40 and unprogrammed of 50.

asr-000604
01:06:21.260 --> 01:06:24.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This year, 50-50.

asr-000605
01:06:24.080 --> 01:06:24.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you.

asr-000606
01:06:26.640 --> 01:06:27.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pensions.

asr-000607
01:06:27.500 --> 01:06:34.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pensions have increased by 13.15%.

asr-000608
01:06:34.540 --> 01:06:40.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Total.

asr-000609
01:06:42.520 --> 01:06:44.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide.

asr-000610
01:06:50.880 --> 01:06:53.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For proposals, Your Honor.

asr-000611
01:06:53.640 --> 01:06:53.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-000612
01:06:55.360 --> 01:06:56.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Our proposals are...

asr-000613
01:06:57.500 --> 01:07:07.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Based on our approximation of threats and costs and sustainability of activities as we plan them based on threats.

asr-000614
01:07:10.380 --> 01:07:21.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's lower by 248 billion compared to the original proposal we made.

asr-000615
01:07:21.980 --> 01:07:26.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But this does not include one-time enhancements of...

asr-000616
01:07:27.500 --> 01:07:34.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But this does not include one-time enhancements of equipment and capabilities which will balloon the figure to very very high amounts.

asr-000617
01:07:34.140 --> 01:07:38.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we just included our basic requirements, Your Honor.

asr-000618
01:07:44.540 --> 01:07:47.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000619
01:07:50.460 --> 01:07:53.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Our breakdown shows as follows, Your Honor.

asr-000620
01:07:53.780 --> 01:07:55.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of course, from the Office of the Secretary...

asr-000621
01:07:57.500 --> 01:08:02.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Secretary, it's less 16% from what was asked.

asr-000622
01:08:02.780 --> 01:08:07.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: From the Army, it's less by 23%.

asr-000623
01:08:07.720 --> 01:08:10.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Air Force, 24%.

asr-000624
01:08:10.520 --> 01:08:12.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Navy, 30%.

asr-000625
01:08:12.400 --> 01:08:15.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And GHQ, 82%.

asr-000626
01:08:15.260 --> 01:08:16.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And why GHQ?

asr-000627
01:08:18.080 --> 01:08:21.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: GHQ, Your Honor, includes the area commands,

asr-000628
01:08:21.700 --> 01:08:24.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which are the principal operating commands.

asr-000629
01:08:24.400 --> 01:08:26.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are five area commands.

asr-000630
01:08:27.500 --> 01:08:32.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And the budget of the area commands come from the GHQ.

asr-000631
01:08:32.880 --> 01:08:36.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Our intelligence command, our sustainment command,

asr-000632
01:08:36.240 --> 01:08:38.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and importantly, our strategic command,

asr-000633
01:08:38.940 --> 01:08:43.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: from which our deterrent capabilities will flow,

asr-000634
01:08:44.420 --> 01:08:47.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: are sourced from the GHQ budget.

asr-000635
01:08:48.140 --> 01:08:53.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So this does not mean to say that it is GHQ itself.

asr-000636
01:08:53.060 --> 01:08:57.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But the budgets of...

asr-000637
01:08:57.500 --> 01:09:02.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: NOLCOM, SOLCOM, WESCOM, BISCOM,

asr-000638
01:09:03.260 --> 01:09:06.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: EASTMINCOM, and WESTMINCOM.

asr-000639
01:09:07.180 --> 01:09:12.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: These are the operating budgets that come out of the GHQ budget.

asr-000640
01:09:13.420 --> 01:09:16.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So the reduction in GHQ

asr-000641
01:09:16.440 --> 01:09:23.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: will result in a gap of operations

asr-000642
01:09:23.700 --> 01:09:26.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: by the area commands,

asr-000643
01:09:26.180 --> 01:09:27.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which are the principal operations,

asr-000644
01:09:27.500 --> 01:09:28.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: operating commands.

asr-000645
01:09:29.160 --> 01:09:31.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And therefore, if that is the case,

asr-000646
01:09:32.680 --> 01:09:35.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: then we will have to concentrate the budget

asr-000647
01:09:35.300 --> 01:09:39.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: on the areas where there is a biggest threat possible.

asr-000648
01:09:39.980 --> 01:09:43.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And that will open us to gaps in the other areas.

asr-000649
01:09:47.640 --> 01:09:49.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In the government arsenal,

asr-000650
01:09:50.520 --> 01:09:54.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: there's a reduction of 11%.

asr-000651
01:09:54.340 --> 01:09:54.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pag muna.

asr-000652
01:09:56.180 --> 01:09:57.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: NDCP,

asr-000653
01:09:57.500 --> 01:09:58.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 6%.

asr-000654
01:09:58.420 --> 01:10:00.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Office of Civil Defense,

asr-000655
01:10:00.680 --> 01:10:01.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 53%.

asr-000656
01:10:01.820 --> 01:10:05.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Philippine Veterans Affairs Office,

asr-000657
01:10:05.580 --> 01:10:06.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 23%.

asr-000658
01:10:06.560 --> 01:10:07.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And Veterans Memorial,

asr-000659
01:10:08.880 --> 01:10:11.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's 61%.

asr-000660
01:10:11.020 --> 01:10:14.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But this does not reflect the

asr-000661
01:10:14.080 --> 01:10:20.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: infrastructure that is going to be sourced

asr-000662
01:10:20.640 --> 01:10:21.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: from the Office of the President.

asr-000663
01:10:23.300 --> 01:10:25.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And for these agencies,

asr-000664
01:10:26.200 --> 01:10:27.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: they have one-time items.

asr-000665
01:10:27.500 --> 01:10:31.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Which for 2025,

asr-000666
01:10:31.820 --> 01:10:34.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which increase their budgets,

asr-000667
01:10:34.540 --> 01:10:35.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: thus the reductions,

asr-000668
01:10:35.940 --> 01:10:36.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-000669
01:10:36.640 --> 01:10:39.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And with the Veterans Memorial Medical Center,

asr-000670
01:10:39.980 --> 01:10:42.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: they have trust receipts from the DOTR

asr-000671
01:10:42.180 --> 01:10:44.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of the subway.

asr-000672
01:10:50.920 --> 01:10:53.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The AFP modernization,

asr-000673
01:10:53.260 --> 01:10:53.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor,

asr-000674
01:10:53.820 --> 01:10:55.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the proposal was 133.

asr-000676
01:10:57.500 --> 01:11:07.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Based on the re-Horizon 3 of the modernization program,

asr-000677
01:11:09.260 --> 01:11:11.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which has already,

asr-000678
01:11:11.700 --> 01:11:14.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's in the process of being revised again

asr-000679
01:11:14.080 --> 01:11:18.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of increased threats and increased costs.

asr-000680
01:11:19.220 --> 01:11:23.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So we once again will appeal,

asr-000681
01:11:23.100 --> 01:11:25.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and I think it's pending on the House

asr-000682
01:11:25.260 --> 01:11:27.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to already abolish the modernization,

asr-000683
01:11:27.500 --> 01:11:28.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: modernization law.

asr-000684
01:11:28.620 --> 01:11:31.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because we cannot work on 15-year horizons,

asr-000685
01:11:31.800 --> 01:11:32.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor,

asr-000686
01:11:32.300 --> 01:11:35.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which the modernization law provides.

asr-000687
01:11:36.460 --> 01:11:40.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is not a sustainable way

asr-000688
01:11:40.560 --> 01:11:45.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: of planning your modernization anymore.

asr-000689
01:11:46.100 --> 01:11:46.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In a more,

asr-000690
01:11:48.380 --> 01:11:50.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for lack of a better term,

asr-000691
01:11:50.420 --> 01:11:52.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but to use an economic term,

asr-000692
01:11:52.420 --> 01:11:57.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: an opportunistic defense market.

asr-000693
01:11:57.500 --> 01:12:00.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is a responsible protected environment.

asr-000694
01:12:00.120 --> 01:12:03.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We propose, Your Honor,

asr-000695
01:12:03.360 --> 01:12:04.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 134 billion,

asr-000696
01:12:05.140 --> 01:12:07.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but only 50 billion was included.

asr-000697
01:12:08.160 --> 01:12:10.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I think the 50 billion,

asr-000698
01:12:10.220 --> 01:12:10.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor,

asr-000699
01:12:10.580 --> 01:12:16.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: there is a sort of attachment

asr-000700
01:12:16.880 --> 01:12:20.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to the 50 billion amount

asr-000701
01:12:20.100 --> 01:12:23.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for the past how many years already?

asr-000702
01:12:24.460 --> 01:12:27.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it was also due to the alignment,

asr-000703
01:12:27.500 --> 01:12:38.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: perhaps of the revised AFP modernization to the basis conversion law and dividends from that.

asr-000704
01:12:38.620 --> 01:12:49.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But we know that the basis conversion BCDA has only remitted a total of 26 billion pesos

asr-000705
01:12:49.440 --> 01:12:57.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to the AFP for the past, no, I'm sorry, 45 billion for the past 26 years.

asr-000706
01:12:58.280 --> 01:13:02.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So it is not a sustainable way of going forward.

asr-000707
01:13:02.600 --> 01:13:09.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And yet it has taken away from us assets which cannot be replicated

asr-000708
01:13:09.080 --> 01:13:13.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of their strategic location and strategic makeup.

asr-000709
01:13:14.360 --> 01:13:18.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So I believe that the,

asr-000710
01:13:19.440 --> 01:13:27.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the situation cannot be allowed to continue that more military reservations

asr-000711
01:13:27.160 --> 01:13:38.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which have to be devoted to national defense are thought of as commercial endeavors.

asr-000712
01:13:39.380 --> 01:13:47.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because at the end of the day, it will not fund your modernization in any significant way at all.

asr-000713
01:13:48.300 --> 01:13:49.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: As history has...

asr-000714
01:13:49.440 --> 01:13:49.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: As history has proven.

asr-000715
01:13:54.340 --> 01:14:03.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So there are relatively few changes, Your Honor, for the rest of the items.

asr-000716
01:14:04.840 --> 01:14:05.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide.

asr-000717
01:14:08.440 --> 01:14:15.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the physical accomplishments, Your Honor, we accomplished 100 percent.

asr-000718
01:14:16.080 --> 01:14:17.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000719
01:14:18.300 --> 01:14:19.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of...

asr-000720
01:14:19.440 --> 01:14:23.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: of D&amp;D OSEC policies.

asr-000721
01:14:24.500 --> 01:14:25.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And I...

asr-000722
01:14:26.040 --> 01:14:34.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I also have to beg the indulgence of everybody here under our department

asr-000723
01:14:34.460 --> 01:14:37.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because any new policy causes a headache to them

asr-000724
01:14:37.720 --> 01:14:42.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and they would wish that I would not be churning out more and more policies anymore.

asr-000725
01:14:44.120 --> 01:14:44.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sorry.

asr-000727
01:14:46.420 --> 01:14:49.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So 80 percent of those policies...

asr-000728
01:14:49.440 --> 01:14:54.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 80 percent of those policies and strategies were accepted by the President and the Cabinet, Your Honor.

asr-000729
01:14:58.360 --> 01:14:59.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000730
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:10.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the AFP, 81% of the tactical units provided force employers.

asr-000731
01:15:14.300 --> 01:15:22.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the Philippine Army, Philippine Air Force 100%, and for the Philippine Navy, 100%, Your Honor.

asr-000732
01:15:22.140 --> 01:15:46.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, I would like to point out that in the case of the Air Force and the Navy, the 100% is not a figure that, of course, for this year and last year, we should be very proud of, but we should be worried if it continues in the future because 100% is unsustainable.

asr-000733
01:15:46.140 --> 01:15:51.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That means to say, we are already at max capacity, if not less.

asr-000734
01:15:52.140 --> 01:16:07.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, that means to say that the capacity of the agencies are not enough to sustain the needs of the environment, Your Honor, that we work in.

asr-000735
01:16:12.780 --> 01:16:14.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Continue, please.

asr-000736
01:16:16.040 --> 01:16:17.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000737
01:16:17.560 --> 01:16:21.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: On the Joint Force Planning Program.

asr-000738
01:16:22.140 --> 01:16:35.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, 234 plans and programs were accomplished, and for the first semester of this year, there were 117 already accomplished.

asr-000739
01:16:35.920 --> 01:16:51.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Most of these, Your Honor, are for joint and combined anticipative actions, training exercises, scenario building, and scoping exercises.

asr-000740
01:16:52.140 --> 01:17:07.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: On operations, Your Honor, the Joint Force Operations Program for operations, 159 were complied with last year out of 182.

asr-000741
01:17:07.980 --> 01:17:20.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And most of these plans were not, the unfulfilled portion was due to natural calamities.

asr-000742
01:17:20.980 --> 01:17:21.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Natural calamities.

asr-000743
01:17:22.140 --> 01:17:33.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That would, of course, necessitate the diversion of the resources to humanitarian assistance and disaster response.

asr-000744
01:17:36.340 --> 01:17:43.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This year, Your Honor, we have already completed 54% of our targets as of the first semester.

asr-000745
01:17:44.380 --> 01:17:48.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, at the end of the year, we expect to complete 100%.

asr-000746
01:17:50.200 --> 01:17:50.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Okay.

asr-000747
01:17:52.140 --> 01:18:13.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For security operations, of course, Your Honor, in connection with and in cooperation with our civilian law enforcement agencies, there are about 5,900 activities that were covered last year and this year, 3,000, the most important of which are the ASEAN series of engagements.

asr-000748
01:18:13.220 --> 01:18:28.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For capability programs, Your Honor, the patients treated by the AFP Medical Center and other station hospitals were 12,000.

asr-000749
01:18:29.100 --> 01:18:42.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Accomplishment was 11,000 as of 2025 with 12,000 targets while this year, Your Honor,

asr-000750
01:18:42.260 --> 01:18:43.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the

asr-000751
01:18:43.220 --> 01:18:51.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: since there was a gap last year, we reduced the target level to 10,000.

asr-000752
01:18:52.340 --> 01:18:58.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We have already had an accomplishment of more than 50%.

asr-000753
01:18:58.200 --> 01:19:12.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ten signed AFP modernization projects are being implemented, so we have 60%, six have already been accomplished for this year.

asr-000754
01:19:12.260 --> 01:19:13.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Last year,

asr-000755
01:19:13.220 --> 01:19:27.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: last year, there were 10 targets, Your Honor, we accomplished 17 because of the previous year's unfulfilled targets.

asr-000756
01:19:29.540 --> 01:19:32.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-000757
01:19:34.340 --> 01:19:35.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Matumal yung atin.

asr-000758
01:19:38.500 --> 01:19:39.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Natutulog yung atin.

asr-000759
01:19:39.800 --> 01:19:40.940
DND Assistant Secretary Romeo N. Dela Cruz: Actually,

asr-000760
01:19:41.180 --> 01:19:41.800
DND Assistant Secretary Romeo N. Dela Cruz: I want to...

asr-000761
01:19:42.340 --> 01:19:42.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I...

asr-000762
01:19:43.220 --> 01:19:44.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Naghang pala yung iyo.

asr-000763
01:19:44.540 --> 01:19:45.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hindi ko mabasa yun.

asr-000764
01:19:47.620 --> 01:19:48.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Naghang yung iyo.

asr-000765
01:19:50.380 --> 01:19:51.840
DND Assistant Secretary Romeo N. Dela Cruz: Yes, sir.

asr-000766
01:19:55.840 --> 01:20:01.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the government arsenal, Your Honor, 98% is the target this year.

asr-000767
01:20:03.120 --> 01:20:10.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Last year, we accomplished only 63% of the target because of the unavailability of propellants,

asr-000768
01:20:10.220 --> 01:20:12.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the shortage of propellants,

asr-000769
01:20:12.380 --> 01:20:16.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and other critical components in the international market.

asr-000770
01:20:17.460 --> 01:20:22.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The situation, Your Honor, in the international market now, it is a seller's market.

asr-000771
01:20:22.260 --> 01:20:41.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And even though you have fixed contracts, they will willingly pay the liquidated damages and other punitive amounts because of the amounts being offered by other users.

asr-000772
01:20:41.700 --> 01:20:46.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Given the several conflicts that are occurring now, both in the Middle East and in Ukraine.

asr-000773
01:20:50.040 --> 01:21:02.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Defense and security leaders capacity, Your Honor, 100% of our research papers have been accepted in the same target this year.

asr-000774
01:21:02.620 --> 01:21:11.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 33% of 53 senior leaders.

asr-000775
01:21:11.700 --> 01:21:15.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This is from the DND and AAP.

asr-000776
01:21:15.860 --> 01:21:17.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And may I correct this too?

asr-000777
01:21:17.460 --> 01:21:18.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's not only senior leaders.

asr-000778
01:21:20.140 --> 01:21:29.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Well, we can say senior leaders too because we opened up the MNSA program to enlisted personnel on the NCO level

asr-000779
01:21:29.380 --> 01:21:38.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because their leadership and their critical skills and critical knowledge is just as important as our officer corps.

asr-000780
01:21:41.700 --> 01:21:48.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And, Your Honor, there is a growth challenge with the NDCP now

asr-000781
01:21:48.260 --> 01:21:59.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because we are in the process of reshaping the curriculum.

asr-000782
01:22:00.200 --> 01:22:04.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Knowing fully well that the national security is multidimensional.

asr-000783
01:22:05.860 --> 01:22:11.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, a fixed paradigm of national security as an academic.

asr-000784
01:22:11.700 --> 01:22:13.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And therefore, will not help.

asr-000785
01:22:15.260 --> 01:22:27.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Therefore, we continue with faculty development, advancing coordination and cooperation with other high-level research agencies, security agencies.

asr-000786
01:22:28.640 --> 01:22:34.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Probably, the national security paradigm before worked in an internal security environment.

asr-000787
01:22:34.700 --> 01:22:41.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But nowadays, with the different dimensions of conflict.

asr-000788
01:22:41.700 --> 01:22:47.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: To include cyber conflict and cognitive warfare and who knows what will happen in the future.

asr-000789
01:22:47.500 --> 01:22:50.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is not anticipative enough.

asr-000790
01:22:51.160 --> 01:22:56.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The academic output of the NDCP.

asr-000791
01:22:59.200 --> 01:23:03.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The teacher to student ratio is still 1 is to 10.

asr-000792
01:23:03.340 --> 01:23:08.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But I still want to know the research output of the institution.

asr-000793
01:23:09.880 --> 01:23:11.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And that is what I keep on putting.

asr-000794
01:23:11.700 --> 01:23:12.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And that is what I keep on pushing them to be doing.

asr-000795
01:23:13.580 --> 01:23:23.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because if they do not publish, they do not produce peer-reviewed publications,

asr-000796
01:23:24.560 --> 01:23:27.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: then we are not passing our job.

asr-000797
01:23:28.720 --> 01:23:32.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We don't pass the test.

asr-000798
01:23:34.520 --> 01:23:35.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, next slide.

asr-000800
01:23:39.320 --> 01:23:41.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: On OCD, Your Honor.

asr-000801
01:23:41.700 --> 01:23:55.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: As we said, that 65% of the, we are concentrating right now on response.

asr-000802
01:23:57.180 --> 01:24:07.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we also had to change the view of the minimum required standards for local governments.

asr-000803
01:24:07.260 --> 01:24:10.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For example, the Gawad Kalinga Awards.

asr-000804
01:24:11.700 --> 01:24:17.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They were even awarding before, awards for more than compliant.

asr-000805
01:24:19.460 --> 01:24:26.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But how can you say you're more than compliant when disaster risk reduction is a continuing endeavor?

asr-000806
01:24:26.500 --> 01:24:34.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And actually, how can you be more compliant with, for example, an earthquake scenario which nobody knows the outcome?

asr-000807
01:24:36.320 --> 01:24:40.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, a more than compliant rating to me is impossible.

asr-000808
01:24:40.520 --> 01:24:52.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we abolished that standard and asked them to refocus on the ability to coordinate,

asr-000809
01:24:53.400 --> 01:25:00.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to exercise leadership in coordination with the different departments and the local government units.

asr-000810
01:25:01.980 --> 01:25:09.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, even the training for first responders, Your Honor,

asr-000811
01:25:09.000 --> 01:25:10.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it should be on a classroom.

asr-000812
01:25:10.000 --> 01:25:14.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It should be on a clustered basis as we see the disasters now.

asr-000813
01:25:14.620 --> 01:25:21.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the paradigm of first responder coming from the affected community,

asr-000814
01:25:21.520 --> 01:25:25.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it does not hold water right now.

asr-000815
01:25:25.680 --> 01:25:34.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because how can they respond when two or three municipalities are subject to stress at the same time?

asr-000816
01:25:35.120 --> 01:25:38.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it needs a different approach.

asr-000817
01:25:38.000 --> 01:25:39.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And I give an example.

asr-000818
01:25:40.000 --> 01:25:45.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For example, for the Ligtas Pinoy Act, where each town should have an evacuation center.

asr-000819
01:25:46.580 --> 01:25:53.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We had a very difficult time right now identifying if that is feasible or not.

asr-000820
01:25:53.680 --> 01:25:57.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Each town should have an evacuation center.

asr-000821
01:25:58.520 --> 01:26:04.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But in an area, perhaps even outside the physical boundaries of that town,

asr-000822
01:26:05.560 --> 01:26:08.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which can support the evacuees.

asr-000823
01:26:10.000 --> 01:26:17.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we had the first list of approved areas for the Ligtas Pinoy centers.

asr-000824
01:26:17.040 --> 01:26:30.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But it will be a continuing challenge for us to identify suitable areas that can accept the quantity of evacuees

asr-000825
01:26:30.280 --> 01:26:36.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: should a disaster affect one area.

asr-000826
01:26:36.680 --> 01:26:39.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: An example would be in the Negros area.

asr-000827
01:26:40.000 --> 01:26:41.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ashfall, Your Honor.

asr-000828
01:26:42.180 --> 01:26:45.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: About four or five municipalities were affected.

asr-000829
01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:52.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But the only safe evacuation center would be in another distant municipality.

asr-000830
01:26:52.940 --> 01:26:59.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The same area, the same situation with Bicol, when you have a six-kilometer exclusion zone.

asr-000831
01:27:00.820 --> 01:27:05.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, that is a dimension which we are working with.

asr-000832
01:27:05.920 --> 01:27:09.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we will also report the results to Congress.

asr-000833
01:27:10.000 --> 01:27:13.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: To refine whatever modifications are needed, Your Honor.

asr-000834
01:27:17.860 --> 01:27:23.820
