DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: uh we were deprived of

asr-001084
01:41:58.160 --> 01:42:04.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: infrastructure that were designed really for military use that have been converted

asr-001085
01:42:04.640 --> 01:42:27.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, the unfunded, Your Honor, comes out to about 87, but I do not know after the House, Your Honor, would have submitted to the Senate their version, how much of this would have been answered for.

asr-001086
01:42:30.140 --> 01:42:31.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide.

asr-001087
01:42:31.060 --> 01:43:01.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the modernization, Your Honor, minimum of 70 just for re-Horizon 3, but we should see there is still Horizon 2 projects that need to be completed, but we also scrapped, repurposed some of them because a lot of Horizon 2 projects are already obsolete.

asr-001088
01:43:01.060 --> 01:43:17.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But this does not include, we have not yet come out, Your Honor, with the recalibration of Horizon 3, which we need to submit to the Senate for the President for approval.

asr-001089
01:43:17.100 --> 01:43:30.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The program of 50 billion, Your Honor.

asr-001090
01:43:31.060 --> 01:44:00.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If we obligate and contract out all of these, we will need 20 billion more from the current 50 billion that is being proposed just to pay for the continuing multi-year continuing obligational authority, which is why also our obligation rate is low.

asr-001091
01:44:01.060 --> 01:44:11.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If we obligate for that year, our payments would balloon and it will be beyond the modernization.

asr-001092
01:44:31.060 --> 01:44:41.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, Your Honor.

asr-001093
01:44:41.380 --> 01:44:45.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: With the indulgence of the Committee, I will move to the next slide, Your Honor.

asr-001094
01:44:56.580 --> 01:44:59.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This one, Your Honor, we already included it last year.

asr-001095
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:17.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In the absence of the amendatory law for the presidential decree, Your Honor, limiting foreign borrowings for defense to 300 million U.S. dollars.

asr-001096
01:45:18.940 --> 01:45:25.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We have a bill already pending, Your Honor, to take that limitation out.

asr-001097
01:45:25.600 --> 01:45:36.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It allows contracting for foreign loans, grants, and other credit facilities.

asr-001098
01:45:37.380 --> 01:45:48.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, under the control of the Secretary of Finance, Your Honor, we fully understand that this has to be subject to fiscal space limitations.

asr-001099
01:45:48.780 --> 01:45:54.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we fully accept the

asr-001100
01:45:55.600 --> 01:45:59.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: seniority and the primacy of the Secretary of Finance in these matters.

asr-001101
01:46:01.060 --> 01:46:04.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So it has been enacted last year.

asr-001102
01:46:04.420 --> 01:46:09.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We did not avail of it, Your Honor, because of the mechanism with the Secretary of Finance.

asr-001103
01:46:12.920 --> 01:46:20.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So we appeal for the same flexibility to be enacted this year.

asr-001104
01:46:23.300 --> 01:46:25.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In anticipation also, Your Honor.

asr-001105
01:46:25.600 --> 01:46:31.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In anticipation also, Your Honor, of the repeal of the 300 million dollar limitation.

asr-001106
01:46:34.060 --> 01:46:36.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is a continuing provision, Your Honor.

asr-001107
01:46:38.420 --> 01:46:46.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we have not availed of it because knowing fiscal space limitations.

asr-001108
01:46:49.640 --> 01:46:50.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Next slide, please.

asr-001109
01:46:52.260 --> 01:46:53.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: This is the last slide, Your Honor.

asr-001110
01:46:53.840 --> 01:46:55.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We shall be open to questions.

asr-001111
01:46:55.600 --> 01:46:58.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: From Your Honors.

asr-001112
01:47:01.360 --> 01:47:03.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Secretary Teodoro.

asr-001113
01:47:04.240 --> 01:47:09.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I will ask my colleagues to go and propound questions first.

asr-001114
01:47:09.120 --> 01:47:14.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But before them, meron lang ano, may patanong lang yung ano, naghahabol kasi mag-media natin.

asr-001115
01:47:14.820 --> 01:47:15.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Deadline, no?

asr-001116
01:47:15.860 --> 01:47:17.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Singit lang ako ng dalawa.

asr-001117
01:47:17.920 --> 01:47:21.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sec, habang nagpe-present kayo ng budget kanina, lumabas sa balita.

asr-001118
01:47:21.660 --> 01:47:24.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Now, allow me to quote the statement of the DFA Secretary,

asr-001119
01:47:24.640 --> 01:47:26.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Department of Foreign Affairs.

asr-001120
01:47:26.800 --> 01:47:32.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Summoned Chinese Ambassador Jing Kuan on October 19 to convey the Philippine serious concern and strong objection.

asr-001121
01:47:33.140 --> 01:47:37.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This October 15 public statement which conveyed the threat to use of force.

asr-001122
01:47:37.640 --> 01:47:42.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So ano ba ang treatment ng DND sa mga ganitong statement ng isang foreign diplomat?

asr-001123
01:47:42.980 --> 01:47:47.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I know that both of us are subject to ano now, no?

asr-001124
01:47:47.420 --> 01:47:53.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Being attacked by, I don't know kung itong mga ito, mga tools to.

asr-001125
01:47:53.200 --> 01:47:53.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I don't know.

asr-001126
01:47:53.980 --> 01:47:54.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But.

asr-001127
01:47:54.640 --> 01:47:57.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We are both, we just want to make, we just want to make it clear.

asr-001128
01:47:58.100 --> 01:48:05.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But that both of us, me and myself and my, the Secretary [unclear], we both studied in Xavier School, both studied Chinese.

asr-001129
01:48:05.960 --> 01:48:10.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And I'm sure that he, we love our Chinese schoolmates and classmates.

asr-001130
01:48:11.660 --> 01:48:18.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So it is not the Chinese people just to be straight at the, to set the record straight.

asr-001131
01:48:18.040 --> 01:48:20.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's the expansionist.

asr-001132
01:48:24.640 --> 01:48:27.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's the stock of Xi Jinping's government.

asr-001133
01:48:27.720 --> 01:48:38.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably, I'm sure just quickly, Secretary Guibo, how does the DND treat this kind of public statement that convey a threat of use of force from the Chinese ambassador?

asr-001134
01:48:38.800 --> 01:48:52.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, consistent with our earlier pronouncements, number one, we refute all allegations made by the ambassador that we are troublemakers and are provoking.

asr-001135
01:48:53.560 --> 01:48:54.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We rate.

asr-001136
01:48:54.640 --> 01:49:07.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We reiterate, nulit namin, Your Honor, ang aming pag-suporta at pag-taguyod sa UNCLOS and the UN Charter.

asr-001137
01:49:09.680 --> 01:49:18.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pangalawa, pinahiwatig na po natin ang ating pag-object sa kanyang pananalita.

asr-001138
01:49:18.660 --> 01:49:22.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi hindi lang naman isang beses sinabi niyang you lose.

asr-001139
01:49:23.020 --> 01:49:24.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yung pinoportray po ngayon.

asr-001140
01:49:24.640 --> 01:49:31.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ay yung we can use force if we want, but we may win easily.

asr-001141
01:49:32.100 --> 01:49:40.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron pong isa na sinabi siya na okay, you cut military communications, but you lose.

asr-001142
01:49:42.700 --> 01:49:48.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So ibig po sabihin, may pagbabantana po doon.

asr-001143
01:49:48.660 --> 01:49:52.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Dalawang beses po niyang sinabi po yan.

asr-001144
01:49:53.560 --> 01:49:54.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ngayon po.

asr-001145
01:49:54.640 --> 01:50:14.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pinatawag na po siya ng DFA, we have to wait, Your Honor, for developments which, of course, the President or the DFA will message to the public at an appropriate time.

asr-001146
01:50:14.780 --> 01:50:24.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero maliwanag po ang ating pagtutol, hindi lang dito sa statement niya, kung hindi, the more important thing, yung kanilang false narrative.

asr-001147
01:50:24.640 --> 01:50:39.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: May nine-dash line, may meron silang jurisdiction, pangatlo, yung kanila pong latest narrative na ang Batanes ay part ng China.

asr-001148
01:50:39.940 --> 01:50:49.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi meron na daw silang karapatan na mag-operate sa mga karagatan na nagpapalibot sa Batanes.

asr-001149
01:50:49.100 --> 01:50:54.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yan po ay matinding tinututulan at aming pong sinusubukan.

asr-001150
01:50:54.640 --> 01:50:57.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Na i-deter yung ganyang klaseng mga behavior.

asr-001151
01:50:58.460 --> 01:50:58.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Salamat po.

asr-001152
01:51:00.440 --> 01:51:01.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-001153
01:51:02.660 --> 01:51:07.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Much has been said over the weekend, and I think this is an opportunity to clarify where we stand.

asr-001154
01:51:08.460 --> 01:51:13.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we believe in diplomacy, but we also believe in developing good relations with our neighbors.

asr-001155
01:51:13.360 --> 01:51:16.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero siyempre, dapat may respeto sa isa't isa.

asr-001156
01:51:17.180 --> 01:51:24.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Medyo hindi na maganda ang kanyang mga aksyon at mga pananalita

asr-001157
01:51:24.640 --> 01:51:29.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na may halong pananakot.

asr-001158
01:51:30.020 --> 01:51:33.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Very hostile and very undiplomatic.

asr-001159
01:51:34.400 --> 01:51:38.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we would like to support our Secretary also.

asr-001160
01:51:38.220 --> 01:51:42.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Your stand also when you were in Singapore.

asr-001161
01:51:42.940 --> 01:51:48.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'd like to commend you for that, for being firm and steadfast in saying that we will protect.

asr-001162
01:51:48.960 --> 01:51:52.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we are just protecting our sovereignty and our territorial integrity.

asr-001163
01:51:53.760 --> 01:51:54.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So...

asr-001164
01:51:54.260 --> 01:51:55.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-001165
01:51:55.640 --> 01:51:56.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for that.

asr-001166
01:51:56.520 --> 01:52:00.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Probably our Senate President would like to ask questions.

asr-001167
01:52:01.480 --> 01:52:05.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. President, I was watching the hearing.

asr-001168
01:52:07.360 --> 01:52:09.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I was waiting actually in my room.

asr-001169
01:52:09.100 --> 01:52:14.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I saw Senator Lacson was waiting here way, way advanced than both of us.

asr-001170
01:52:14.920 --> 01:52:21.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So I will yield to Senator Lacson who came in first before we both came in.

asr-001171
01:52:21.700 --> 01:52:24.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Senator Lacson will now propound.

asr-001172
01:52:24.260 --> 01:52:25.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: His questions and concerns.

asr-001173
01:52:25.920 --> 01:52:26.120
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yeah.

asr-001174
01:52:26.240 --> 01:52:28.060
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Thank you, Mr. President and Mr. Chairman.

asr-001175
01:52:29.200 --> 01:52:32.340
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung isang item dito, yung unused appropriations.

asr-001176
01:52:32.340 --> 01:52:39.540
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Of course, when we speak of unused appropriations, it is the total of unobligated at saka unreleased.

asr-001177
01:52:40.020 --> 01:52:47.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: For 2024, pag pinagsama yung dalawa, nasa mga 32 billion.

asr-001178
01:52:49.140 --> 01:52:50.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 32 million.

asr-001179
01:52:50.780 --> 01:52:50.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah.

asr-001180
01:52:51.420 --> 01:52:51.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Billion.

asr-001181
01:52:51.880 --> 01:52:53.060
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 32 billion.

asr-001182
01:52:53.580 --> 01:52:54.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 2022.

asr-001183
01:52:54.260 --> 01:52:58.240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Wala na ito kasi under the continuing appropriations, 2 years lang eh.

asr-001184
01:52:59.040 --> 01:53:02.020
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In 2025, nasa mga 31 billion.

asr-001185
01:53:03.140 --> 01:53:05.900
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Again, unobligated and unreleased.

asr-001186
01:53:06.640 --> 01:53:10.260
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So what would account for the...

asr-001187
01:53:11.280 --> 01:53:19.080
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I think this is huge numbers, 31 billion in unused appropriations for 2025.

asr-001188
01:53:20.080 --> 01:53:21.940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: What would account, sir,

asr-001188-split-2
01:53:21.940 --> 01:53:22.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: are the

asr-001189
01:53:22.720 --> 01:53:28.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: inflationary pressures dun sa mga kinakailangan po natin i-acquire.

asr-001190
01:53:28.760 --> 01:53:41.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At dun naman po sa limited na capital outlay, dahil po sa costings ng materials, umaakyat po yung halaga.

asr-001191
01:53:41.740 --> 01:53:42.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kaya po, kung...

asr-001192
01:53:43.860 --> 01:53:52.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pangantlo po, yung pag ginamit yung ibang items po dun sa unobligated,

asr-001193
01:53:52.100 --> 01:53:54.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pag inobligate po, tataas.

asr-001194
01:53:54.260 --> 01:53:57.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Tapos pa po yung MICA natin sa amount ng modernization.

asr-001195
01:53:58.720 --> 01:54:06.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, yung fiscal constraints po, and yung pag-costing po ng mga horizons,

asr-001196
01:54:08.120 --> 01:54:11.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: gumagapang po yung presyo halos araw-araw.

asr-001197
01:54:11.940 --> 01:54:15.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, pag may nakita...

asr-001198
01:54:15.000 --> 01:54:18.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Unang-una po, baka dun po sa approved bid ceiling kasi,

asr-001199
01:54:19.040 --> 01:54:21.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: doon po sa mga reglamento natin,

asr-001200
01:54:22.240 --> 01:54:23.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hindi na po...

asr-001201
01:54:24.260 --> 01:54:27.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ayun sa presyo na gusto natin.

asr-001202
01:54:30.240 --> 01:54:40.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pangalawa po, yung ating pong patakaran na kailangan po yung platforms are fully weaponized

asr-001203
01:54:40.220 --> 01:54:44.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and provided with reserves kasi yun po ang nakikita.

asr-001204
01:54:45.660 --> 01:54:51.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Actually, very, very conservative yung reserves natin na 30 days na munitions per platform.

asr-001205
01:54:51.720 --> 01:54:53.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero alam po natin na humahaba.

asr-001206
01:54:54.260 --> 01:54:57.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At hindi na po yung panahon na kailangan po natin na reserba.

asr-001207
01:54:58.100 --> 01:55:02.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yun po ang primary reason po from 2024.

asr-001208
01:55:02.980 --> 01:55:06.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because I remember, at the end of 2023 po,

asr-001209
01:55:06.560 --> 01:55:08.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: doon pumasok ang ReHorizon 3.

asr-001210
01:55:08.900 --> 01:55:12.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi nag-revisa po kami ng kinakailangan, kaya nagbago po ito.

asr-001211
01:55:14.300 --> 01:55:17.780
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, the next relevant question would be,

asr-001212
01:55:18.100 --> 01:55:19.700
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: how do we resolve this issue?

asr-001213
01:55:19.840 --> 01:55:21.600
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi year in, year out,

asr-001214
01:55:21.600 --> 01:55:23.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: ito lagi yung nagiging problem.

asr-001215
01:55:24.260 --> 01:55:27.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: We're trying to catch up, but it seems that we are not catching up.

asr-001216
01:55:28.660 --> 01:55:36.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, there should really be a determination to have continuous defense spending increases

asr-001217
01:55:36.020 --> 01:55:42.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which will impact the total fiscal picture of the government.

asr-001218
01:55:43.100 --> 01:55:45.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I will give an example, Your Honor.

asr-001219
01:55:45.100 --> 01:55:53.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang Singapore from day one ng panganak niya in 1965 or 66,

asr-001220
01:55:53.540 --> 01:55:54.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 6%.

asr-001221
01:55:54.260 --> 01:55:59.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ng GDP at the minimum ang ginagastos po nila.

asr-001222
01:55:59.700 --> 01:56:04.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Tayo po ay sa core defense spending, wala pa po sa dos.

asr-001223
01:56:05.160 --> 01:56:07.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Nasasakal na po yung budget natin.

asr-001224
01:56:08.200 --> 01:56:14.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I think it should be a determination, Your Honor,

asr-001225
01:56:14.480 --> 01:56:18.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na we raise the amount through financing

asr-001226
01:56:18.760 --> 01:56:21.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because if we make a determination,

asr-001227
01:56:21.240 --> 01:56:23.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nagagastusin lang talaga ito.

asr-001228
01:56:23.380 --> 01:56:24.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: On the future,

asr-001229
01:56:24.260 --> 01:56:25.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for generations,

asr-001230
01:56:25.940 --> 01:56:26.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: mabuti pa,

asr-001231
01:56:27.400 --> 01:56:30.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: umpisahan na natin ang tama sa ngayon

asr-001232
01:56:30.180 --> 01:56:33.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: kesa sa pamahal ng pamahal o pasikip ng pasikip ito.

asr-001233
01:56:34.700 --> 01:56:38.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, I think it is a macroeconomic problem

asr-001234
01:56:38.960 --> 01:56:41.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: that has to be solved macroeconomically.

asr-001235
01:56:42.200 --> 01:56:43.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pangalawa naman po,

asr-001236
01:56:44.520 --> 01:56:47.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nile-leverage din po natin ang alliances natin

asr-001237
01:56:47.900 --> 01:56:51.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: katulad ng official security assistance ng Japan

asr-001238
01:56:51.020 --> 01:56:54.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na 200 million kada taon na US dollars.

asr-001239
01:56:54.260 --> 01:56:57.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At FMF financing sa US

asr-001240
01:56:57.700 --> 01:57:03.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: at sa iba pa pong partners sa Australia at sa Canada in the future.

asr-001241
01:57:03.700 --> 01:57:08.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero hindi ito substitute po talaga.

asr-001242
01:57:08.360 --> 01:57:10.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And I see your point, Your Honor.

asr-001243
01:57:10.900 --> 01:57:15.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I think it will go beyond my mandate

asr-001244
01:57:15.500 --> 01:57:21.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to view a solution to this problem.

asr-001245
01:57:21.940 --> 01:57:24.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The acquisition,

asr-001246
01:57:24.140 --> 01:57:28.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the avenues of getting the funds,

asr-001247
01:57:29.580 --> 01:57:31.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we can probably remediate,

asr-001248
01:57:32.060 --> 01:57:35.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but the repayment is the problem

asr-001249
01:57:35.460 --> 01:57:37.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which transcends the D&amp;D.

asr-001250
01:57:40.800 --> 01:57:44.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We are really reflecting the realities

asr-001251
01:57:44.420 --> 01:57:48.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: of the costs that we need.

asr-001252
01:57:49.120 --> 01:57:50.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At the end of the day,

asr-001253
01:57:50.180 --> 01:57:51.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's a political decision

asr-001254
01:57:51.400 --> 01:57:53.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: whether you fund this

asr-001255
01:57:53.060 --> 01:57:53.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: versus,

asr-001256
01:57:53.580 --> 01:57:55.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: versus something else.

asr-001257
01:57:55.020 --> 01:57:56.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because it's really a zero-sum game.

asr-001258
01:57:57.540 --> 01:57:59.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There's no denying it.

asr-001259
01:58:03.580 --> 01:58:05.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's as best as I can answer

asr-001260
01:58:05.940 --> 01:58:07.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: our Vice Chairperson.

asr-001261
01:58:08.720 --> 01:58:10.300
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001262
01:58:10.560 --> 01:58:12.180
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Before I move on to another topic,

asr-001263
01:58:12.300 --> 01:58:13.520
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I'd like to find out from COA,

asr-001264
01:58:14.060 --> 01:58:17.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: are there major procurement issues

asr-001265
01:58:17.280 --> 01:58:20.520
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: that should merit our attention

asr-001266
01:58:20.520 --> 01:58:22.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: regarding the D&amp;D?

asr-001267
01:58:23.580 --> 01:58:26.540
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001268
01:58:26.540 --> 01:58:27.460
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: Thank you.

asr-001269
01:58:27.460 --> 01:58:28.560
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: Good afternoon, Sir, Your Honor.

asr-001270
01:58:29.260 --> 01:58:31.720
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: For the D&amp;D OSEC, Sir,

asr-001271
01:58:31.880 --> 01:58:33.060
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: in which I am the supervising...

asr-001272
01:58:33.060 --> 01:58:33.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Not just the OSEC,

asr-001273
01:58:34.020 --> 01:58:35.620
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: the establishment.

asr-001274
01:58:37.140 --> 01:58:38.800
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: May I call on the other

asr-001275
01:58:38.800 --> 01:58:40.140
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: supervising auditor, Sir?

asr-001276
01:58:40.720 --> 01:58:41.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yeah, please.

asr-001277
01:58:42.300 --> 01:58:45.140
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: For the Armed Forces of the Philippines,

asr-001278
01:58:46.220 --> 01:58:47.700
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: the General Headquarters.

asr-001279
01:58:49.340 --> 01:58:49.660
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: May I?

asr-001280
01:58:49.660 --> 01:58:50.980
COA Supervising Auditor Rosana A. Alconcel: Thank you.

asr-001281
01:58:53.580 --> 01:59:09.600
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kaya lang ako concerned kasi so many years ago, same budget deliberation sa DND, meron kami nakitang COA issue na 10 years na hindi pa na-deliver, laging in transit.

asr-001282
01:59:09.600 --> 01:59:36.920
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So ang tanong ni Senator Enrile noon, ang tagal naman mag-deliver yan, 10 years pa. Every year, recurring yung issue being raised by COA. So hindi na na-deliver sa end user. So these are the issues that I'm talking about. Kung meron mga parallel or similar issues na dapat i-attend or maybe pwede nang burahin sa libro nyo kasi 10 years, hindi pa dumarating eh.

asr-001283
01:59:39.600 --> 01:59:59.860
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: Good afternoon everyone, Your Honor. Regarding po dun sa deliveries, wala naman po tayong question about po dun sa actual delivery but more on documentation. And ongoing naman po yung retrieval ng mga documents. Yun nga po nandun po tayo sa 10 years.

asr-001284
02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:05.640
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: But, however, yung ongoing coordination naman po is currently conducted po.

asr-001285
02:00:05.880 --> 02:00:08.940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Any other specific issues that you can share with us, with the committee?

asr-001286
02:00:09.640 --> 02:00:09.980
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: Ano naman?

asr-001287
02:00:10.540 --> 02:00:11.140
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: Ano po.

asr-001288
02:00:11.860 --> 02:00:12.720
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, totoo yan ah?

asr-001289
02:00:12.860 --> 02:00:13.360
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: Yes po.

asr-001290
02:00:13.740 --> 02:00:13.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Okay.

asr-001291
02:00:14.400 --> 02:00:14.820
COA Supervising Auditor Norina Rose L. Yao: Thank you.

asr-001292
02:00:16.600 --> 02:00:28.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Doon sa malay na foreign influence and interference, yung security sector, meron ba tayong data and substantiated reports?

asr-001293
02:00:28.040 --> 02:00:35.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Of actual malign interference by foreign jurisdictions against our country?

asr-001294
02:00:35.680 --> 02:00:42.700
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Considering na hindi pa natin ipasa yung amendment ng decades-old anti-espionage law?

asr-001295
02:00:43.480 --> 02:00:46.860
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, how do we confront this kind of a situation?

asr-001296
02:00:47.860 --> 02:00:57.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, we can only confront it now if there is a predicate crime that has been committed.

asr-001297
02:00:57.740 --> 02:00:57.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Or is...

asr-001298
02:00:58.040 --> 02:00:59.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's in the process of being committed.

asr-001299
02:01:00.580 --> 02:01:14.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And what we have seen so far is on the economic sabotage aspect, like money laundering, human trafficking aspect also, Your Honor.

asr-001300
02:01:14.400 --> 02:01:25.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And environmental standards plus fake citizenships.

asr-001301
02:01:26.980 --> 02:01:27.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, on the...

asr-001302
02:01:28.040 --> 02:01:37.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Activities, actually, sir, that will be maligned, we have information.

asr-001303
02:01:37.860 --> 02:01:46.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, substantiated information is quite difficult given the constraints that we have.

asr-001304
02:01:47.000 --> 02:01:57.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Particularly for the connections between influencer and influence.

asr-001305
02:01:58.040 --> 02:01:59.840
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Political influence, ano?

asr-001306
02:02:00.180 --> 02:02:01.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Political, sir, and others.

asr-001307
02:02:01.740 --> 02:02:03.580
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: That's part of the malign interference, eh?

asr-001308
02:02:03.620 --> 02:02:04.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001309
02:02:04.300 --> 02:02:13.320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung covert operations na influencing, you know, even the mga GNC, hindi ba?

asr-001310
02:02:13.560 --> 02:02:13.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001311
02:02:14.120 --> 02:02:15.460
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Through social media and all.

asr-001312
02:02:15.460 --> 02:02:21.800
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Now, what has happened to the arrests conducted by, I think, the NBI, you know?

asr-001313
02:02:22.980 --> 02:02:27.460
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: By foreign agents conducting surveillance?

asr-001314
02:02:28.040 --> 02:02:32.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Surveillance operations sa near Camp Aguinaldo, and then also sa Comelec.

asr-001315
02:02:32.620 --> 02:02:38.320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: We asked this during the first committee hearing of the anti-espionage law, yung bill.

asr-001316
02:02:38.560 --> 02:02:38.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001317
02:02:39.620 --> 02:02:41.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, walang feedback, eh?

asr-001318
02:02:41.900 --> 02:02:49.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, on the recent disruption operation, it was a Pogo operation.

asr-001319
02:02:50.820 --> 02:02:53.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We are still exploiting the recovery.

asr-001320
02:02:53.800 --> 02:02:56.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But the important thing is that the...

asr-001321
02:02:58.040 --> 02:03:00.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hub was closed down.

asr-001322
02:03:01.320 --> 02:03:08.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And about more or less a hundred were taken by the BI.

asr-001323
02:03:08.700 --> 02:03:16.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, they are awaiting deportation proceedings.

asr-001324
02:03:16.700 --> 02:03:26.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I think deportation proceedings now are the most effective way of dealing with the persons apprehended.

asr-001325
02:03:27.460 --> 02:03:27.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Unless...

asr-001326
02:03:28.040 --> 02:03:29.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, they are principals.

asr-001327
02:03:30.120 --> 02:03:33.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because if they are subjected to judicial processes,

asr-001328
02:03:35.500 --> 02:03:42.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: somehow, sometimes, they are able to continue the activities.

asr-001329
02:03:43.920 --> 02:03:48.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's better that they are gone unless they are principals.

asr-001330
02:03:48.240 --> 02:03:50.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For example, Your Honor Alice Go,

asr-001331
02:03:51.000 --> 02:03:55.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which was a cut-and-dried case insofar as we're concerned.

asr-001332
02:03:55.320 --> 02:03:58.000
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: It had nothing to do with the malign interference or...

asr-001333
02:03:58.120 --> 02:03:58.940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Espionage operations.

asr-001334
02:03:59.160 --> 02:04:01.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We are still in the process, sir, of...

asr-001335
02:04:01.860 --> 02:04:03.000
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Hindi pa na-validate.

asr-001336
02:04:03.260 --> 02:04:03.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hindi pa sir na-validate.

asr-001337
02:04:03.620 --> 02:04:05.820
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So far, Pogo yung nakita niyong motive.

asr-001338
02:04:05.820 --> 02:04:06.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So far, Pogo, sir.

asr-001339
02:04:07.280 --> 02:04:09.660
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Pero ang location niya nakakapagtaka.

asr-001340
02:04:10.600 --> 02:04:19.520
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Katulad, parang yung Pogo na na-disrupt sa likod ng DFA noong 2023 or 2024.

asr-001341
02:04:21.640 --> 02:04:26.240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: May analysis na doon sa equipment, surveillance equipment that were confiscated.

asr-001342
02:04:26.240 --> 02:04:27.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ginagawa pa sa kasuluku yan, sir.

asr-001343
02:04:28.040 --> 02:04:28.960
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Matagal na yun, ah.

asr-001344
02:04:29.660 --> 02:04:31.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Last week lang yata, sir.

asr-001345
02:04:31.180 --> 02:04:35.220
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: No, no. Recent. I think this was one or two years ago.

asr-001346
02:04:35.540 --> 02:04:41.780
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I was referring to the arrests made by, I think, NBI yata or PNP.

asr-001347
02:04:42.840 --> 02:04:45.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I'm not sure about that, Your Honor.

asr-001348
02:04:45.440 --> 02:04:49.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I think close coordination should be made with the Armed Forces Intelligence.

asr-001349
02:04:49.620 --> 02:04:50.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001350
02:04:50.420 --> 02:04:53.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: This could involve national security.

asr-001351
02:04:53.280 --> 02:04:55.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, Your Honor, one constraint.

asr-001352
02:04:56.020 --> 02:04:57.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Assuming that there is...

asr-001353
02:04:58.040 --> 02:05:20.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sometimes, what we have encountered in cases that we want to follow up is that to disrupt, to exploit a computer or a device would need a data warrant, another legal proceeding.

asr-001354
02:05:20.580 --> 02:05:26.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, I will find out, Your Honor, about the status kasi marami na po eh.

asr-001355
02:05:26.780 --> 02:05:27.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang interesting...

asr-001356
02:05:28.040 --> 02:05:30.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang interesting thing po namin ay tumigil yung operation.

asr-001357
02:05:31.560 --> 02:05:40.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Katulad po nung ibang mga na-disrupt natin, hindi naman lang yung fake na or substandard na ginagawa.

asr-001358
02:05:40.180 --> 02:05:43.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kung hindi may [unclear] ito eh, nalabas-pasok ang...

asr-001359
02:05:44.380 --> 02:05:45.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Matigil lang po yun.

asr-001360
02:05:47.280 --> 02:05:51.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Initially, ay one half of the problem solved.

asr-001361
02:05:51.480 --> 02:05:57.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi hindi na pwedeng gamitin yung lugar nalabas-pasok ang kung sino.

asr-001362
02:05:58.040 --> 02:06:02.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, about the devices, Your Honor, I will find out, Your Honor.

asr-001363
02:06:03.860 --> 02:06:11.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Those arrests that I was referring to, nangyari last year eh, near Comelec and in the vicinity of Camp Aguinaldo.

asr-001364
02:06:11.860 --> 02:06:13.800
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And that should tell us a lot, ano?

asr-001365
02:06:13.940 --> 02:06:21.060
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi kung Camp Aguinaldo and these are supposed to be foreign agents, then that should be a major concern.

asr-001366
02:06:21.560 --> 02:06:23.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Threat sa national security.

asr-001367
02:06:24.020 --> 02:06:24.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We'll find out, Your Honor.

asr-001368
02:06:25.260 --> 02:06:26.120
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yeah, please.

asr-001369
02:06:26.580 --> 02:06:28.020
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And please do something about it.

asr-001370
02:06:28.040 --> 02:06:33.580
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Because baka mamaya, may mga reports din tayo, may mga sleeper na, di ba?

asr-001371
02:06:34.140 --> 02:06:34.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001372
02:06:34.740 --> 02:06:35.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In the country.

asr-001373
02:06:36.340 --> 02:06:42.320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And this could be tied to the reports of late registration of birth.

asr-001374
02:06:42.920 --> 02:06:43.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001375
02:06:43.520 --> 02:06:46.660
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ang last count yata, nasa mga 3,000 ba o 5,000?

asr-001376
02:06:47.300 --> 02:06:48.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, I'm not sure of the amount.

asr-001377
02:06:48.700 --> 02:06:49.480
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Identified, yeah.

asr-001378
02:06:49.520 --> 02:06:50.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001379
02:06:51.320 --> 02:06:55.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Identified the personalities na late registration.

asr-001380
02:06:55.880 --> 02:06:57.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I don't know what's the status now.

asr-001381
02:06:58.040 --> 02:07:00.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kung ano na ginawa ng PSA.

asr-001382
02:07:00.720 --> 02:07:03.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Tinanong rin namin sa PSA ito during the budget deliberation.

asr-001383
02:07:04.100 --> 02:07:07.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And they're trying to find some remedial measures.

asr-001384
02:07:08.400 --> 02:07:11.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: But, you know, masyado malalim na pag ganyang karami.

asr-001385
02:07:12.120 --> 02:07:13.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Malalim na po talaga, sir.

asr-001386
02:07:13.460 --> 02:07:15.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At yung iba, second generation na eh.

asr-001387
02:07:16.420 --> 02:07:23.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang pasok dito ng magulang ay talagang, ano, yung anak naman ang pinag-late registration.

asr-001388
02:07:25.040 --> 02:07:25.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Di umano.

asr-001389
02:07:25.940 --> 02:07:27.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Si Alice Gu ay ganun din.

asr-001390
02:07:28.040 --> 02:07:34.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero, meron din nagsasabi na hindi nga ganun ang nangyari sa kanya.

asr-001391
02:07:36.960 --> 02:07:39.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Bagong pasok, bagong register.

asr-001392
02:07:42.100 --> 02:07:45.460
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Anyway, kindly look into it, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001393
02:07:45.600 --> 02:07:46.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Will do, sir.

asr-001394
02:07:46.120 --> 02:07:47.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we'll report to you.

asr-001395
02:07:48.060 --> 02:07:52.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I will yield the floor to Senator Tulfo or the Senate President, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001396
02:07:55.360 --> 02:07:56.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our Senate President.

asr-001397
02:07:56.580 --> 02:07:57.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

asr-001398
02:07:57.520 --> 02:07:57.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you.

asr-001399
02:07:58.040 --> 02:07:58.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001400
02:08:00.160 --> 02:08:08.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll start off, Mr. Chairman, with some budgets, some of the items in the 2026 budget.

asr-001401
02:08:09.600 --> 02:08:14.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na-discuss ni Secretary ito kanina, yung sa loan.

asr-001402
02:08:15.620 --> 02:08:22.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I would like to understand how come the special provision wasn't triggered.

asr-001403
02:08:22.940 --> 02:08:23.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think it was...

asr-001404
02:08:24.760 --> 02:08:27.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nalagay natin itong special provision in foreign...

asr-001405
02:08:28.040 --> 02:08:29.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and domestic financing arrangements.

asr-001406
02:08:30.700 --> 02:08:34.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: This is an offshoot from an information from the Coast Guard.

asr-001407
02:08:35.920 --> 02:08:41.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang Coast Guard, nakasecure sila ng ODA to buy Coast Guard ships.

asr-001408
02:08:42.720 --> 02:08:46.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, last year, we had a discussion.

asr-001409
02:08:46.260 --> 02:08:49.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sabi natin bakit hindi natin gawin the same for the defense, no?

asr-001410
02:08:49.320 --> 02:08:51.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Whether ODA or other forms of loans.

asr-001411
02:08:52.300 --> 02:08:54.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And hence, nalagay natin itong provision.

asr-001412
02:08:54.700 --> 02:08:57.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I want to understand, Secretary, how come hindi siya nagamit?

asr-001413
02:08:57.400 --> 02:08:59.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is it too tight?

asr-001414
02:08:59.460 --> 02:09:02.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is it not kulang pa sa language?

asr-001415
02:09:03.420 --> 02:09:07.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: May we understand kung ano naging result nito, no?

asr-001416
02:09:07.880 --> 02:09:11.580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's an innovation, actually, proposed by the Secretary.

asr-001417
02:09:11.980 --> 02:09:20.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And sabi ko nga, this is a good way of multiplying the financial capacity of the armed forces or the DND.

asr-001418
02:09:20.900 --> 02:09:25.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are basically two reasons, Your Honor.

asr-001419
02:09:25.520 --> 02:09:26.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That there's a tight...

asr-001420
02:09:27.400 --> 02:09:29.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: fiscal space for what we need.

asr-001421
02:09:29.400 --> 02:09:32.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hence, the provision could not be triggered.

asr-001422
02:09:32.680 --> 02:09:38.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And secondly, we were not able, insofar as the proposal sent to us,

asr-001423
02:09:39.260 --> 02:09:43.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to get the financing in the rate that we want.

asr-001424
02:09:44.100 --> 02:09:48.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It was too expensive, Your Honor, for us to trigger.

asr-001425
02:09:48.620 --> 02:09:50.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hence, we did not trigger, Your Honor.

asr-001426
02:09:50.580 --> 02:09:52.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero merong sanong opportunity?

asr-001427
02:09:53.220 --> 02:09:55.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron, pero mataas po ang financing cost.

asr-001428
02:09:55.800 --> 02:09:56.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hindi lang po mataas.

asr-001429
02:09:57.400 --> 02:09:58.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yung cost.

asr-001430
02:09:58.820 --> 02:10:00.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero pati financing cost, mataas.

asr-001431
02:10:01.780 --> 02:10:03.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's a timing issue na rin.

asr-001432
02:10:03.540 --> 02:10:05.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Timing issue, triggering issue, Your Honor.

asr-001433
02:10:06.060 --> 02:10:13.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And do you propose to include natin ito ulit sa 2027 budget?

asr-001434
02:10:13.280 --> 02:10:16.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It will provide us with the flexibility, Your Honor,

asr-001435
02:10:16.500 --> 02:10:25.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: until the Presidential Decree limiting the amount of foreign borrowings that we can do for defense

asr-001436
02:10:25.340 --> 02:10:27.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to 300 million pesos a year.

asr-001437
02:10:27.240 --> 02:10:27.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Is that right?

asr-001438
02:10:27.280 --> 02:10:27.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001439
02:10:27.300 --> 02:10:32.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, we would request it, very humbly request it again, Your Honor.

asr-001440
02:10:33.260 --> 02:10:35.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: With the assurance that we will not trigger, Your Honor,

asr-001441
02:10:36.060 --> 02:10:39.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: unless the Department of Finance is comfortable with it

asr-001442
02:10:39.940 --> 02:10:45.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and we are comfortable also with the item that is being acquired.

asr-001443
02:10:45.840 --> 02:10:48.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: With the terms of the financing, no?

asr-001444
02:10:48.380 --> 02:10:49.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001445
02:10:49.200 --> 02:10:55.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi ngayon, admittedly, because of government bonds, everything is expensive right now.

asr-001446
02:10:55.620 --> 02:10:57.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Even in India, Your Honor?

asr-001447
02:10:57.300 --> 02:11:01.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They increase the yield to 5.13% in government bonds.

asr-001448
02:11:01.720 --> 02:11:06.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, because to defend the Indian currency.

asr-001449
02:11:07.160 --> 02:11:09.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it's a worldwide phenomenon.

asr-001450
02:11:09.540 --> 02:11:10.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes, correct.

asr-001451
02:11:10.020 --> 02:11:15.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's actually a reason why peso is weakening because of foreign interest rates.

asr-001452
02:11:15.580 --> 02:11:21.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And with critical infrastructure that we need financing to, we understand the mix, Your Honor.

asr-001453
02:11:21.620 --> 02:11:27.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But if we find a need that we can fill with the terms that our...

asr-001454
02:11:27.300 --> 02:11:32.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We feel, Your Honor, will not be replicated any time,

asr-001455
02:11:32.560 --> 02:11:37.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: then we will not hesitate to ask the Secretary of Finance to trigger it.

asr-001456
02:11:37.500 --> 02:11:39.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How about Secretary ODAs?

asr-001457
02:11:39.160 --> 02:11:40.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi ODAs are more competitive.

asr-001458
02:11:41.260 --> 02:11:45.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I'm not very sure whether that's available for defense equipment.

asr-001459
02:11:46.040 --> 02:11:50.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know they're available for PCG, which is a civilian type of operation,

asr-001460
02:11:51.140 --> 02:11:52.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: law enforcement type of operation.

asr-001461
02:11:52.780 --> 02:11:56.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But for defense, I'm not very sure kung available yung mga ganyan sa defense.

asr-001462
02:11:56.620 --> 02:11:57.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: No, Your Honor.

asr-001463
02:11:57.320 --> 02:11:58.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They're not available normally.

asr-001464
02:11:59.460 --> 02:12:04.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: With Japan, as a matter of fact, there's the official security assistance,

asr-001465
02:12:05.040 --> 02:12:07.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which is a grant of 200 million.

asr-001466
02:12:07.460 --> 02:12:09.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For the past three years, we were the recipients.

asr-001467
02:12:11.460 --> 02:12:21.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But normal ODA financing, which has to conform to OECD and other requirements,

asr-001468
02:12:22.040 --> 02:12:23.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: still defends.

asr-001469
02:12:23.740 --> 02:12:26.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are some countries that accept it and some none.

asr-001470
02:12:27.300 --> 02:12:32.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So the financing for defense are special purpose credit agencies

asr-001471
02:12:32.840 --> 02:12:38.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: normally tied to exports of the providing country, Your Honor.

asr-001472
02:12:39.080 --> 02:12:40.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you for that information.

asr-001473
02:12:40.520 --> 02:12:47.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We'll propose to the Chairman to re-include the special provision for financing

asr-001474
02:12:47.800 --> 02:12:52.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and for foreign and domestic financing.

asr-001475
02:12:52.760 --> 02:12:53.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-001476
02:12:53.500 --> 02:12:56.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: In the same way that we did not trigger this, Your Honor,

asr-001477
02:12:56.380 --> 02:13:03.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we did not obligate the full amount of the 50 billion modernization

asr-001478
02:13:03.340 --> 02:13:10.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because it will result in a payable of more than the 50 billion this year to about 80.

asr-001479
02:13:10.420 --> 02:13:13.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So you're also very conservative in triggering that, Your Honor.

asr-001480
02:13:14.400 --> 02:13:15.240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-001481
02:13:15.580 --> 02:13:17.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I'm sure kayo, being a finance guy before,

asr-001482
02:13:18.560 --> 02:13:23.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kabisado nyo yung mga ganitong impact to our balance sheet.

asr-001483
02:13:24.200 --> 02:13:24.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah.

asr-001484
02:13:24.280 --> 02:13:26.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll go to...

asr-001485
02:13:26.380 --> 02:13:28.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: A related item.

asr-001486
02:13:28.720 --> 02:13:32.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: This is on modernization, Secretary.

asr-001487
02:13:32.060 --> 02:13:42.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And this has been a really challenging activity of appropriation

asr-001488
02:13:42.780 --> 02:13:44.760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: because malaking amount siya.

asr-001489
02:13:45.840 --> 02:13:55.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And last year, there was an allocation in the unprogrammed funds of...

asr-001490
02:13:56.380 --> 02:13:57.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: 50 billion.

asr-001491
02:13:58.840 --> 02:14:03.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And na-trigger ba itong unprogrammed funds?

asr-001492
02:14:03.420 --> 02:14:06.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I just want to understand whether it has been triggered.

asr-001493
02:14:07.020 --> 02:14:09.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Normally yan, nasa dulo na third, fourth quarter.

asr-001494
02:14:10.120 --> 02:14:10.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I'm not...

asr-001495
02:14:11.500 --> 02:14:18.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The rationale there is lower down the line items in the unprogrammed

asr-001496
02:14:18.940 --> 02:14:21.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: para ma-prioritize ka agad yung modernization

asr-001497
02:14:21.440 --> 02:14:24.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and ma-trigger at mabigay ka agad sa AFP yung ano.

asr-001498
02:14:24.500 --> 02:14:26.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But I want to get an update whether na-trigger

asr-001499
02:14:26.380 --> 02:14:27.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ho siya o hindi.

asr-001500
02:14:27.720 --> 02:14:32.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, in the same manner as we did not trigger the other items,

asr-001501
02:14:32.680 --> 02:14:38.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because it would balloon the modernization payables alone for this year,

asr-001502
02:14:38.300 --> 02:14:39.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we did not trigger the unprogrammed.

asr-001503
02:14:39.960 --> 02:14:44.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And we could not trigger it because the total of the amount,

asr-001504
02:14:44.980 --> 02:14:45.960
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: both programmed and unprogrammed,

asr-001505
02:14:47.360 --> 02:14:52.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: probably would be the full amount of regular modernization infra

asr-001506
02:14:52.580 --> 02:14:55.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: just to pay the obligations.

asr-001507
02:14:56.380 --> 02:14:56.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-001508
02:14:57.240 --> 02:14:59.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, it's a...

asr-001509
02:14:59.920 --> 02:15:05.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: available, but the timing is not favorable?

asr-001510
02:15:06.480 --> 02:15:06.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001511
02:15:07.180 --> 02:15:09.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We obligated 84%.

asr-001512
02:15:09.620 --> 02:15:15.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The 12% trigger would cause us to exceed the 50 billion threshold.

asr-001513
02:15:16.320 --> 02:15:20.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Actually, our payable for MICA this year would be about 70, right?

asr-001514
02:15:22.800 --> 02:15:23.440
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 50.

asr-001515
02:15:23.560 --> 02:15:26.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But if we trigger the 12%, it will be about 70.

asr-001516
02:15:26.840 --> 02:15:28.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That is the constraint, Your Honor.

asr-001517
02:15:28.500 --> 02:15:28.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Okay.

asr-001518
02:15:28.800 --> 02:15:31.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's why we're not triggering the 12%.

asr-001519
02:15:31.880 --> 02:15:34.520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And because what you said earlier, it's a seller's market.

asr-001520
02:15:34.900 --> 02:15:35.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001521
02:15:35.580 --> 02:15:37.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, mahal ang equipment ngayon?

asr-001522
02:15:38.660 --> 02:15:41.760
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Mahal po ang equipment at pamahal pa ng pamahal

asr-001523
02:15:41.760 --> 02:15:47.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because even the raw material inputs sa equipment ay umaakyat po.

asr-001524
02:15:47.440 --> 02:15:55.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Critical minerals, semiconductors, electronics, bakal, copper,

asr-001525
02:15:55.480 --> 02:15:58.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: other inputs, lumalaki.

asr-001526
02:15:58.800 --> 02:16:01.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, with what's happening around the world right now,

asr-001527
02:16:01.240 --> 02:16:01.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung mga conflicts,

asr-001528
02:16:02.660 --> 02:16:05.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang impact niyan is yung presyo ng equipment.

asr-001529
02:16:06.640 --> 02:16:08.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tumataas siya at this time.

asr-001530
02:16:08.020 --> 02:16:09.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Opo, at saka yung demand po mataas.

asr-001531
02:16:10.300 --> 02:16:12.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, yung presyo po umaakyat.

asr-001532
02:16:13.080 --> 02:16:18.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi doon lang po sa munitions,

asr-001533
02:16:18.460 --> 02:16:20.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which is not an item of modernization.

asr-001534
02:16:20.680 --> 02:16:26.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: For 105 and 155 mm ammunition,

asr-001535
02:16:27.920 --> 02:16:28.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: bumibigyan.

asr-001536
02:16:28.800 --> 02:16:31.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Bumibili pa po sa secondary market kung may countries

asr-001537
02:16:31.740 --> 02:16:33.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na pwede magbenta ng stock nila

asr-001538
02:16:33.820 --> 02:16:38.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: para masupply lang doon sa Ukraine or other countries.

asr-001539
02:16:40.180 --> 02:16:42.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Or sa Israel, actually.

asr-001540
02:16:43.240 --> 02:16:44.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Bumibili nung araw po.

asr-001541
02:16:45.440 --> 02:16:50.480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, complicated itong situation natin when it comes to defense equipment.

asr-001542
02:16:50.720 --> 02:16:51.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi po...

asr-001543
02:16:51.560 --> 02:16:53.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Interrelated itong mga conflicts to us.

asr-001544
02:16:54.680 --> 02:16:56.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Historically po, after...

asr-001545
02:16:56.860 --> 02:16:57.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: After...

asr-001546
02:16:58.800 --> 02:17:01.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: After the fall of the Berlin Wall,

asr-001547
02:17:03.300 --> 02:17:08.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: in-scale down po yung tooling of production for defense equipment worldwide.

asr-001548
02:17:08.900 --> 02:17:09.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Lalo na po sa Europe.

asr-001549
02:17:11.080 --> 02:17:14.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, ngayon, humahabol pa po sila sa capacity

asr-001550
02:17:14.060 --> 02:17:19.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: just to supply Ukraine insofar as the EU is concerned.

asr-001551
02:17:19.180 --> 02:17:22.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, wala pa po sila sa full capacity.

asr-001552
02:17:22.840 --> 02:17:24.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Actually po, ang...

asr-001553
02:17:24.920 --> 02:17:28.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang Germany po ay...

asr-001554
02:17:28.800 --> 02:17:34.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If I'm not mistaken, 500 billion euro ang kanyang modernization.

asr-001555
02:17:34.480 --> 02:17:42.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Hindi pa niya na uubos po kasi wala pong capacity to produce pa ang kanyang bansa.

asr-001556
02:17:43.740 --> 02:17:47.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it is also a question po of availability

asr-001557
02:17:47.060 --> 02:17:51.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of limited lines of production.

asr-001558
02:17:52.040 --> 02:17:55.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because of the scale down of defense equipment.

asr-001559
02:17:55.680 --> 02:17:57.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The only country, Your Honor,

asr-001560
02:17:58.800 --> 02:18:03.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: in our environment,

asr-001561
02:18:04.060 --> 02:18:06.200
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: in our like-minded environment,

asr-001562
02:18:06.700 --> 02:18:11.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: that is equipped but not totally equipped

asr-001563
02:18:11.420 --> 02:18:17.420
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to supply 100% of its clients' demands is Korea.

asr-001564
02:18:17.420 --> 02:18:23.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Which is why we have a comprehensive strategic partnership with them

asr-001565
02:18:23.860 --> 02:18:26.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and joint development with them.

asr-001566
02:18:27.480 --> 02:18:28.640
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They were the only ones...

asr-001567
02:18:28.640 --> 02:18:28.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They were the only ones...

asr-001568
02:18:28.660 --> 02:18:29.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: They were the only ones, Your Honor,

asr-001569
02:18:29.460 --> 02:18:35.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: never to slow down their production and industrial base

asr-001570
02:18:35.060 --> 02:18:37.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: for producing defense equipment.

asr-001571
02:18:38.480 --> 02:18:40.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ngayon kasi, ano talaga eh.

asr-001572
02:18:40.380 --> 02:18:42.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I mean, you can see it in the news na

asr-001573
02:18:42.220 --> 02:18:46.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: parang buong mundo.

asr-001574
02:18:48.400 --> 02:18:50.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Something's happening in different parts of the region

asr-001575
02:18:50.560 --> 02:18:55.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and definitely a lot of countries now are stocking up,

asr-001576
02:18:55.600 --> 02:18:58.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: modernizing, increasing their capabilities,

asr-001577
02:18:58.660 --> 02:19:03.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and, of course, for us who are also modernizing,

asr-001578
02:19:03.420 --> 02:19:07.400
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: it's with very, very limited resources,

asr-001579
02:19:08.020 --> 02:19:11.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: impacted tayo with those conflicts.

asr-001580
02:19:11.660 --> 02:19:14.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Your Honor, may I point out also in ASEAN, for example,

asr-001581
02:19:15.620 --> 02:19:19.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Indonesia has ordered 47 new fighters,

asr-001582
02:19:21.240 --> 02:19:27.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: the top-of-the-line Rafales from France.

asr-001583
02:19:27.100 --> 02:19:28.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Malaysia is...

asr-001584
02:19:28.660 --> 02:19:32.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's continuing to expand its capabilities.

asr-001585
02:19:33.260 --> 02:19:35.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Actually, they had the missile defense contract

asr-001586
02:19:35.580 --> 02:19:38.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which was canceled by, I believe, Finland

asr-001587
02:19:38.160 --> 02:19:42.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because they needed to recommit it somewhere else.

asr-001588
02:19:42.720 --> 02:19:43.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: I'm not sure...

asr-001589
02:19:43.660 --> 02:19:45.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: No, it's Norway, I think.

asr-001590
02:19:46.020 --> 02:19:50.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Even Brunei is buying what we heard

asr-001591
02:19:50.320 --> 02:19:53.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: is that they are acquiring their first F-50s.

asr-001592
02:19:54.580 --> 02:19:58.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So everybody within the region is really building up

asr-001593
02:19:58.120 --> 02:19:58.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: its own...

asr-001594
02:19:58.500 --> 02:19:59.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Its own capabilities.

asr-001595
02:20:00.220 --> 02:20:03.400
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Of course, the outlier there is Singapore

asr-001596
02:20:03.400 --> 02:20:05.060
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because it has always done so

asr-001597
02:20:05.060 --> 02:20:09.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: from day one of its creation, Your Honor.

asr-001598
02:20:10.480 --> 02:20:11.900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Secretary, is this a...

asr-001599
02:20:11.900 --> 02:20:13.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: From a policy point of view,

asr-001600
02:20:13.480 --> 02:20:15.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: is this a signal that the whole...

asr-001601
02:20:15.780 --> 02:20:18.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the entire world right now is changing

asr-001602
02:20:18.460 --> 02:20:21.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: in terms of their mindset on defense?

asr-001603
02:20:22.300 --> 02:20:22.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yes.

asr-001604
02:20:22.440 --> 02:20:27.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because it's becoming more volatile in our region,

asr-001605
02:20:27.540 --> 02:20:28.360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: definitely our regions,

asr-001606
02:20:28.500 --> 02:20:29.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: becoming more volatile,

asr-001607
02:20:29.600 --> 02:20:32.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: as we can see in the West Philippine Sea.

asr-001608
02:20:32.480 --> 02:20:33.980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But in the other parts of the world,

asr-001609
02:20:34.040 --> 02:20:35.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: it's also doing the same.

asr-001610
02:20:35.840 --> 02:20:36.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think, Your Honor,

asr-001611
02:20:37.180 --> 02:20:39.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it's not only a question of volatility

asr-001612
02:20:39.720 --> 02:20:42.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which you will need to deter and to address,

asr-001613
02:20:42.580 --> 02:20:46.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but a question also of long-term resilience.

asr-001614
02:20:47.200 --> 02:20:50.720
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Many countries do not want to be faced with a situation

asr-001615
02:20:50.720 --> 02:20:53.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: where they will not be able to deter

asr-001616
02:20:53.900 --> 02:20:57.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: with the basic capability and weight,

asr-001617
02:20:58.500 --> 02:21:04.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: or rely totally on an organization

asr-001618
02:21:04.800 --> 02:21:08.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: or a conglomeration of countries to come to your aid.

asr-001619
02:21:09.440 --> 02:21:12.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: If at all it comes to that,

asr-001620
02:21:12.260 --> 02:21:16.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: you will still have to wait for some period of time

asr-001621
02:21:16.120 --> 02:21:17.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: before help comes.

asr-001622
02:21:18.300 --> 02:21:21.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That's why you have to build up that basic amount of resilience

asr-001623
02:21:21.460 --> 02:21:24.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to survive in the meantime.

asr-001624
02:21:25.220 --> 02:21:27.280
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But most importantly, Your Honor,

asr-001625
02:21:27.880 --> 02:21:28.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it is also...

asr-001626
02:21:28.500 --> 02:21:36.680
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It is also a reality that a more robust defense setup

asr-001627
02:21:36.680 --> 02:21:40.800
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: deters aggressive actions against...

asr-001628
02:21:40.800 --> 02:21:44.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it is a deterrent to aggressive actions and to conflict.

asr-001629
02:21:47.440 --> 02:21:50.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: More importantly than the need to use it,

asr-001630
02:21:51.040 --> 02:21:58.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it is a warning to make an aggressor have a second thought.

asr-001631
02:21:58.500 --> 02:22:01.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Before it even attempts to do so.

asr-001632
02:22:02.220 --> 02:22:03.840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Parang yun yung sinasabi ni Trump,

asr-001633
02:22:04.960 --> 02:22:06.800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: peace through strength.

asr-001634
02:22:07.520 --> 02:22:08.260
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001635
02:22:08.360 --> 02:22:09.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's just like, you know,

asr-001636
02:22:09.280 --> 02:22:11.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: building a high fence in your house,

asr-001637
02:22:11.100 --> 02:22:15.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it deters people from coming in.

asr-001638
02:22:15.560 --> 02:22:16.360
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: It's the same way.

asr-001639
02:22:17.440 --> 02:22:18.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001640
02:22:18.600 --> 02:22:20.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I'll go to Mr. Chairman.

asr-001641
02:22:20.200 --> 02:22:21.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Do you have any...

asr-001642
02:22:21.140 --> 02:22:24.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, si Senator Tulfo wants to interject

asr-001643
02:22:24.880 --> 02:22:27.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with your indulgence, Senate President.

asr-001644
02:22:28.500 --> 02:22:30.420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yes, Mr. Secretary,

asr-001645
02:22:30.620 --> 02:22:33.240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: with the indulgence, of course, of our Senate President.

asr-001646
02:22:36.180 --> 02:22:38.980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sa arap po ng mga pahayag lately po

asr-001647
02:22:38.980 --> 02:22:41.240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng ambasador po ng China

asr-001648
02:22:41.240 --> 02:22:44.960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: at ito patuloy po na tensyon sa West Philippine Sea,

asr-001649
02:22:46.000 --> 02:22:48.920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ano po ang kongkretong paghanda po

asr-001650
02:22:48.920 --> 02:22:51.400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: or pwedeng ihanda ng Armed Forces of the Philippines

asr-001651
02:22:51.400 --> 02:22:53.580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para maprotektahan po ating teritoryo,

asr-001652
02:22:54.500 --> 02:22:56.020
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: mga sundalo at mga mamayan

asr-001653
02:22:56.020 --> 02:22:57.620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa kabila po ng...

asr-001654
02:22:58.500 --> 02:23:00.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: mindset

asr-001655
02:23:00.160 --> 02:23:02.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na naitatag

asr-001656
02:23:02.180 --> 02:23:03.540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng mga dating opisyal

asr-001657
02:23:03.540 --> 02:23:05.980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na isang nuklear lang

asr-001658
02:23:05.980 --> 02:23:07.580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sasabog na tayo,

asr-001659
02:23:08.140 --> 02:23:09.640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na lulusubin tayo,

asr-001660
02:23:09.640 --> 02:23:11.040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na dudurugin tayo.

asr-001661
02:23:11.580 --> 02:23:13.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Wala naman po tayong ginagawa, di ba?

asr-001662
02:23:13.740 --> 02:23:15.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Na pag-umalma tayo.

asr-001663
02:23:15.960 --> 02:23:17.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, yung mga tao naman,

asr-001664
02:23:18.140 --> 02:23:19.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: kagad sinasabi,

asr-001665
02:23:19.460 --> 02:23:20.320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: magagawa natin,

asr-001666
02:23:20.600 --> 02:23:21.640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: bubombahin tayo,

asr-001667
02:23:21.720 --> 02:23:22.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: gegyarahin,

asr-001668
02:23:22.400 --> 02:23:24.960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: because of these pronouncements before

asr-001669
02:23:24.960 --> 02:23:27.080
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng mga officials natin,

asr-001670
02:23:27.160 --> 02:23:27.640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na parang tumatakot,

asr-001671
02:23:28.500 --> 02:23:30.220
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: tatak na sa isipan ng mga kababayan natin,

asr-001672
02:23:30.360 --> 02:23:31.840
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: huwag na lang po tayo magsalita,

asr-001673
02:23:31.940 --> 02:23:33.700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: nakakatakot, kawawa tayo.

asr-001674
02:23:35.020 --> 02:23:36.700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tapos itong recently pa,

asr-001675
02:23:37.760 --> 02:23:39.760
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na pailan daw po sila

asr-001676
02:23:39.760 --> 02:23:42.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ng persona non grata,

asr-001677
02:23:42.880 --> 02:23:44.260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: then yung mga opisyal natin,

asr-001678
02:23:44.440 --> 02:23:46.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hindi nila tatanggapin doon.

asr-001679
02:23:46.720 --> 02:23:48.260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung mga opisyal naman siguro na ito,

asr-001680
02:23:48.340 --> 02:23:49.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I'm sure, wala naman silang interest

asr-001681
02:23:49.940 --> 02:23:51.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: din na pumunta ho doon sa lugar na yun.

asr-001682
02:23:52.240 --> 02:23:54.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero, what kind of preparations are you doing now

asr-001683
02:23:54.480 --> 02:23:56.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: to counter this,

asr-001684
02:23:56.100 --> 02:23:58.240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: to allay the fears,

asr-001685
02:23:58.500 --> 02:23:59.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: of the public,

asr-001686
02:23:59.640 --> 02:24:00.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na bubombahin tayo,

asr-001687
02:24:01.100 --> 02:24:03.940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: nuklear, dodorogin, etc., etc.?

asr-001688
02:24:03.940 --> 02:24:04.660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mr. Secretary?

asr-001689
02:24:05.900 --> 02:24:07.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Unang-una po talagang,

asr-001690
02:24:07.540 --> 02:24:09.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we're trying our best really

asr-001691
02:24:09.740 --> 02:24:12.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to work not only singly,

asr-001692
02:24:13.080 --> 02:24:16.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pero with our other allies

asr-001693
02:24:16.120 --> 02:24:21.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to deter any more aggressive physical actions

asr-001694
02:24:21.320 --> 02:24:24.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: on a military sense by China.

asr-001695
02:24:24.300 --> 02:24:27.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And it is not only a threat to us,

asr-001696
02:24:28.500 --> 02:24:29.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: it is also a threat to Vietnam,

asr-001697
02:24:30.380 --> 02:24:30.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to Malaysia,

asr-001698
02:24:31.280 --> 02:24:34.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and to Brunei,

asr-001699
02:24:35.100 --> 02:24:37.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and a threat to Japan,

asr-001700
02:24:37.180 --> 02:24:41.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: where their actions are equally aggressive,

asr-001701
02:24:41.480 --> 02:24:44.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: not to the extent that we are facing

asr-001702
02:24:44.500 --> 02:24:46.900
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: because of the proximity of

asr-001703
02:24:46.900 --> 02:24:51.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: 800 kilometers away from China

asr-001704
02:24:51.780 --> 02:24:56.840
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: to the shores of Palawan

asr-001705
02:24:56.840 --> 02:24:58.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: in the West Philippines,

asr-001706
02:24:58.500 --> 02:25:00.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: and South China Sea area,

asr-001707
02:25:00.780 --> 02:25:03.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pero sa haba po ng ating

asr-001708
02:25:03.740 --> 02:25:07.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: boundary sa Pacific Ocean.

asr-001709
02:25:07.180 --> 02:25:09.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, ang kanila pong behavior,

asr-001710
02:25:09.740 --> 02:25:11.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: hindi lang po sa atin,

asr-001711
02:25:11.500 --> 02:25:12.660
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: kahit po sa India,

asr-001712
02:25:12.660 --> 02:25:15.340
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: may inaakuna naman sila na lupain.

asr-001713
02:25:15.340 --> 02:25:17.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, pati po ang India,

asr-001714
02:25:17.500 --> 02:25:21.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: meron na silang karanasan

asr-001715
02:25:21.500 --> 02:25:25.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na nagka border conflict na ilang beses,

asr-001716
02:25:25.500 --> 02:25:28.380
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nagiging mas agresibo po sila.

asr-001717
02:25:28.380 --> 02:25:30.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So, it stands to reason

asr-001718
02:25:30.880 --> 02:25:35.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na although may individual response tayo

asr-001719
02:25:35.120 --> 02:25:35.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: na dependent,

asr-001720
02:25:36.820 --> 02:25:39.080
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: actually more than response po,

asr-001721
02:25:39.320 --> 02:25:41.500
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang ating dapat gawin

asr-001722
02:25:41.500 --> 02:25:42.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: is to build deterrence.

asr-001723
02:25:43.840 --> 02:25:45.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Magdalawang isip muna,

asr-001724
02:25:45.500 --> 02:25:46.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: kahit sino,

asr-001725
02:25:46.900 --> 02:25:47.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: kahit sino,

asr-001726
02:25:48.280 --> 02:25:49.580
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: bago tayo guluhin.

asr-001727
02:25:50.400 --> 02:25:53.140
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi maaari nating pasakitin ang ulo nila.

asr-001728
02:25:53.460 --> 02:25:55.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At it's not worth it at the end of the day.

asr-001729
02:25:56.660 --> 02:25:57.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero,

asr-001730
02:25:57.100 --> 02:25:57.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: so,

asr-001731
02:25:57.220 --> 02:26:01.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: habang ginagawa po natin yan,

asr-001732
02:26:01.220 --> 02:26:06.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: a collective deterrence is necessary po.

asr-001733
02:26:08.220 --> 02:26:11.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Even with Russia po na napakalakas eh,

asr-001734
02:26:11.220 --> 02:26:13.220
