asr-001740
02:26:30.220 --> 02:26:33.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kasi siya ang outlier dito eh.

asr-001741
02:26:33.220 --> 02:26:34.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang outlier po,

asr-001742
02:26:34.220 --> 02:26:36.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: kasi siyang nagliklaim ng,

asr-001743
