asr-001744
02:26:38.220 --> 02:26:40.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: yung nine-dash line po niya.

asr-001745
02:26:40.220 --> 02:26:42.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At hindi lang po yan eh.

asr-001746
02:26:42.220 --> 02:26:45.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kung pumayag tayo ng nine-dash line ngayon,

asr-001747
