DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: eto na nga,

asr-001748
02:26:47.220 --> 02:26:48.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: pati Batanes po,

asr-001749
02:26:48.220 --> 02:26:50.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: sinasama na po nila yan.

asr-001750
02:26:50.220 --> 02:26:52.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Baka hanggang,

asr-001751
