02:29:25.400 --> 02:29:27.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: by the Chinese ambassador, pag may

asr-001825
02:29:27.460 --> 02:29:29.320
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: nagtatanggol pa dyan, talagang

asr-001826
02:29:29.320 --> 02:29:31.160
