DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: ang kanilang posisyon.

asr-001830
02:29:39.600 --> 02:29:41.780
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero meron po talaga, we cannot deny it.

asr-001831
