Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Lackson

asr-001833
02:29:48.160 --> 02:29:49.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: would like to interject.

asr-001834
02:29:50.220 --> 02:29:51.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: With his permission, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001835
02:29:51.680 --> 02:29:53.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: there seems to be a glaring discussion

asr-001836
02:29:53.760 --> 02:29:54.760
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: about the disparity

asr-001837
02:29:54.760 --> 02:29:56.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: on our defense spending

asr-001838
02:29:56.440 --> 02:29:58.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: compared to our regional peers,

asr-001839
02:29:58.440 --> 02:30:00.260
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: particularly China.

asr-001840
02:30:01.120 --> 02:30:06.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi yung kanilang defense expenditure is 52 times ng Pilipinas.

asr-001841
02:30:07.220 --> 02:30:13.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Sa kanila, 335 billion US dollars or roughly 2.1 trillion pesos.

asr-001842
02:30:14.560 --> 02:30:20.460
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So how do we compensate? How do we do a David against a Goliath in this regard?

asr-001843
02:30:21.040 --> 02:30:23.540
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi wala naman tayo magagawa except mag-improvise, hindi ba?

asr-001844
02:30:24.300 --> 02:30:27.060
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So meron ba tayong plano man lang?

asr-001845
02:30:27.060 --> 02:30:31.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sir, the best way is to make ourselves an uninviting target.

asr-001846
02:30:32.600 --> 02:30:43.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: The hard part there is that an uninviting target would mean only our land domain,

asr-001847
02:30:43.740 --> 02:30:51.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which is only 20% of our total territory, 20 to 30%.

asr-001848
02:30:51.440 --> 02:30:56.120
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: However, for the land domain to be resilient, we need full expansion.

asr-001849
02:30:57.060 --> 02:31:01.520
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Exploitation and exploration of the 80% maritime domain.

asr-001850
02:31:02.760 --> 02:31:05.860
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So yun ho ang nagpapakomplicate ng situation.

asr-001851
02:31:06.560 --> 02:31:14.460
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Pero I believe ho that with the X billion reported by China,

asr-001852
02:31:14.600 --> 02:31:19.980
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: this is even understated because a lot of the budget does not go to the PLA

asr-001853
02:31:19.980 --> 02:31:25.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: but to the maritime militia, the Coast Guard, which are basically under the PLA.

asr-001854
02:31:25.880 --> 02:31:29.220
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But not officially reported.

asr-001855
02:31:30.040 --> 02:31:37.480
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: So there is no substitute ho but to build a level of resilience

asr-001856
02:31:37.480 --> 02:31:41.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: which will make it very unattractive for them.

asr-001857
02:31:41.120 --> 02:31:48.880
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: There are ways ho and we can also in executive sessions share some thoughts on it, Your Honors.

asr-001858
02:31:49.600 --> 02:31:55.180
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Can I see how we can match China, for example, sa mga warships, missiles?

asr-001859
02:31:55.180 --> 02:31:55.760
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Wala tayo.

asr-001860
02:31:55.880 --> 02:31:57.120
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Wala tayong verwidal.

asr-001861
02:31:57.640 --> 02:31:59.260
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Let's accept the fact.

asr-001862
02:31:59.880 --> 02:32:01.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So kailan mag-improvise tayo.

asr-001863
02:32:01.800 --> 02:32:06.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Like what Ukraine is doing against Russia, for lack of a better analogy,

asr-001864
02:32:07.560 --> 02:32:14.180
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: baka we should also embark on a similar program na less costly pero effective.

asr-001865
02:32:15.180 --> 02:32:15.800
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And we can match.

asr-001866
02:32:15.860 --> 02:32:22.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Aside from, of course, our alliances, mutual defense treaties, yung ating SOPA,

asr-001867
02:32:22.040 --> 02:32:25.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: and sabi nyo nga kanina, yung kapapasalamang na treaties,

asr-001868
02:32:25.880 --> 02:32:27.320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: treaty with France.

asr-001869
02:32:27.960 --> 02:32:33.000
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So aside from that, but we cannot solely rely on our allies.

asr-001870
02:32:33.280 --> 02:32:37.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi they have their own national interests to contend with.

asr-001871
02:32:37.280 --> 02:32:38.820
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In the first place, yung France, medyo magulo.

asr-001872
02:32:39.800 --> 02:32:46.400
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So kailan mag-improvise tayo and I hope we are on the same page on this.

asr-001873
02:32:46.560 --> 02:32:47.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: We cannot just divulge.

asr-001874
02:32:48.360 --> 02:32:50.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung ongoing programs natin.

asr-001875
02:32:50.240 --> 02:32:53.340
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: But I was told that there is such a program.

asr-001876
02:32:53.640 --> 02:32:54.100
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron, sir.

asr-001877
02:32:54.120 --> 02:32:54.560
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ongoing.

asr-001878
02:32:54.560 --> 02:32:55.600
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Meron po.

asr-001879
02:32:55.600 --> 02:33:11.000
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At kaya po, mire-focus na natin si Director Amano sa higher capabilities na pwede natin gamitin based on Ukraine.

asr-001880
02:33:11.960 --> 02:33:15.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Ang maganda din pong halimbawa dito ay yung Vietnamese experience.

asr-001881
02:33:15.940 --> 02:33:25.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Na talagang matatag din ang tayo nila sa China.

asr-001882
02:33:25.600 --> 02:33:29.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: At ginera na sila nung araw at hindi umubra.

asr-001883
02:33:29.940 --> 02:33:38.020
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yun nga lang, iba talaga yung make-up ng Vietnamese society kesa sa atin.

asr-001884
02:33:38.180 --> 02:33:40.740
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Sanay naman talaga sila sa...

asr-001885
02:33:40.740 --> 02:33:42.240
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Yun ang balakid po sa atin.

asr-001886
02:33:42.440 --> 02:33:47.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Kaya kailangan ho its deterrence rather than retaliation.

asr-001887
02:33:48.060 --> 02:33:50.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And that's why ho in our alliances,

asr-001888
02:33:50.160 --> 02:33:55.160
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: we are focusing on the non-retaliatory features of...

asr-001889
02:33:55.600 --> 02:33:57.300
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: of our defense alliances.

asr-001890
02:33:57.300 --> 02:34:03.700
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But focusing on the deterrence portion po.

asr-001891
02:34:04.700 --> 02:34:09.040
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: We will never match China in terms of pound-for-pound capability.

asr-001892
02:34:09.040 --> 02:34:13.940
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: But we will make the decision calculus as unfavorable to it as possible.

asr-001893
02:34:14.260 --> 02:34:15.540
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: That is the goal, Your Honor.

asr-001894
02:34:16.200 --> 02:34:16.500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Thank you.

